    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03242813105be8aaa6a9b637",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总是会不自觉地熬夜\\n有时会因为睡眠不足导致体力下降",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ab0644e878a602ce305f01de6b715816b13710e4ef62db9aed694a32ed5e870",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d377b5bca8bd4ca09c6c803",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使是练习也不曾懈怠\\n训练不容易失败",
      "source_fingerprint": "319420a363d62d29eb68b8e0e44421f282d258073df7ec15a56c5cb2306ac184",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57930ab4eb5b45ace4f04a21",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以与＜天狼星＞队的成员进行友情训练\\n不会陷入「熬夜」和「懒惰成性」状态",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9addf1faf5aff29664e0215f488efeb9eda06b3599d725c9744e09d503b3e05",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15856b83972d9e283c7eabc4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以与聚集于宝座的人们进行友情训练\\n不会陷入「熬夜」和「懒惰成性」状态",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd439c4534d1bd6ef92e5e40481b5e3be7f640513c92c1d9c332f3cb27a94a60",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72b5ad3b7fd3c401d29e95c8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以与作为先祖的引导者们进行友情训练\\n不会陷入「熬夜」和「懒惰成性」状态",
      "source_fingerprint": "818f6c5b6ade5dea9da1fb5dbed7cbcb7413d362775f5903bfea4e247e695cca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b168c52600c96669adc572fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以与留下印记的人们进行友情训练\\n不会陷入「熬夜」和「懒惰成性」状态",
      "source_fingerprint": "b499548ed2bed1213458759ffc33815c7be407804fcdde992dc0649ae020ca7f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:520266bc1c3a81f3da09949a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以与传说的体现者进行友情训练\\n不会再获得状态「熬夜倾向」和「懒惰」",
      "source_fingerprint": "14dea75cdfad810550ba150b208e6d931650325806a408186a87f171250a73ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cef7e7f23515cae8e63ac26",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过认真的练习来争取明日的胜利\\n训练很难失败",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8c2b9a95e2f3d249c99f4494570aa447b292ea7adb206a9300e555731154592",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3db9ab21c4ebac9089909dbf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不明原因导致状态不佳，身心都消沉了起来……\\n直到秋天，训练都容易失败",
      "source_fingerprint": "e432ad0cc73e4ae8b1081bb100178080e526eac2e237caa323ad3854e41d0769",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77739e2289139cfe623139f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身心充实，精神饱满!\\n训练不容易失败",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d2df79322c10da542b98e49b13a6cbad6dc496b76f49198ffe6d3458e1ab6d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71fceddf91511ae6d71ae0f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "札幌・函馆的比赛获胜的话\\n能够与粉丝再会，获得力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "40ed1d40f67d8e893e3a72ad38979bbfe8c7198c4ad80b97196ae08cf46e1e78",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af012fc1596a4921cf677834",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "福岛・新潟・盛岡的比赛获胜的话\\n能够与粉丝再会，获得力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fec347e91f5d8fb17f060a31e1bb1dbff2e7b99e6e0d6ef5866bf8adf579121",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d6ee8dc21d5f71afcb3b2cf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中山・船桥的比赛获胜的话\\n能够与粉丝再会，获得力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "f57411bbb6f14a0cbc3706ad83dace14ac71e190ca435c499138b5c9502d5c93",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d4741acfb6b471668ab4224",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "京都・阪神的比赛获胜的话\\n能够与粉丝再会，获得力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "1328f47ef30f3089a90d9c1ed04ff759e3b0408a85891bfef4e3bd89608856fb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:836a7e2304a0c2a139688305",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "小仓的比赛获胜的话\\n能够与粉丝再会，获得力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "db7afb64a52c9dbcb779af8041c080cfc2265323d0c058c44c6ff5ca87245c1d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6aacc6c90227d01995dba27",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身体还没有进入本格化时期……\\n参加比赛有时会很疲惫",
      "source_fingerprint": "2912c0550ce62ab8a1968b26c464a4649457389d9e24aef83b8f2b76fafc0847",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae69ea3f7bb4d9971d283699",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今天不去练习也无所谓吧……\\n有时会不去训练",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb72930117e81a11b1f8ae0d90ef5df0b10f4f3e8a328b1a331c6d6b0cff5fdc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35b13d48852526ab2af75eeb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要不在“不擅长练习”状态下参加目标比赛，\\n就能表现出色，轻松成长。但纤细的双脚会被连续的赛程累垮",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a67be79e9fd3ffbe3d5f79274d91c6775d517555b6637518c49ff447eee784e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e8bf04b288d36f8f2d3cedf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "气脉似乎有些紊乱……\\n也许会发生一些不妙的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d7b66904272993dcd6c0ca01266b908e3eeaf50abcb5d4f9540f0a0f260f3d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e38b5fad98e634a79cdcec7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "川崎的比赛获胜的话\\n能够与粉丝再会，获得力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "3904790e8a2ab159f80e8d57e97323ab101b756899ac193c5cdd45854aae780c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2e5525a27d1f08bb822dc7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在赌上最后一冠的比赛中绽放耀眼的意志之光芒，\\n发挥出无可置疑的英雄之力",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa626433f1e3c1b593457255f1b8fda6fb2f0cb1ade06b44c71aab33cb77b2dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45e352992fac54f9d5d51e50",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "双脚还在成长中，在强负荷下发挥很不稳定，\\n参加比赛会感到疲劳",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf543ef9b3ab719b566e2ad388d3b535f9fc743d099ac18749c408b7195ace68",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63be02eb4f5564f30ff51cba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "靠坚强精神来保持干劲！\\n防止干劲下降1次，随后此状态消失",
      "source_fingerprint": "b34fc33d519919193afeb4e95287159f918b2d9bc9c4961e38fa1625b39faeb8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "25"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48d2f0532cd891520e76f2d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今天好像有点儿幸运！　保护自己免受负面状态\\n影响1次，随后此状态消失",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e9c432aeb47252b315e300d92afd088125c9a461fe59809740387b98b6a23cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92926e70da178b391a8f8e4a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "克服困难获得短距离重赏比赛4胜以上的话\\n能够与结下誓言的少女再会，获得力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "47c22e6cb4c63e5208a69759c73f35fdea63e4dbb0a9429abfd09cc052de3385",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "27"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8f8a40fe3d0d211ba647d4b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "克服激战获得短距离重赏比赛7胜以上的话\\n能够与结下誓言的少女再会，获得力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c06bebc99b20479725fc82fd1cbebf962a7ffcc4022eea754053a1095f2d23a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "28"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e94084ac0384ac13b6291ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "克服困难获得英里重赏比赛4胜以上的话\\n能够与结下誓言的少女再会，获得力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd47fca4546a6e45946bd7f2c5da38846feb83b6f7d3d12525180d3531f852c5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "29"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b66e78a5b14211f12bb82502",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正是会在意皮肤状态的年纪\\n有时会导致干劲下降",
      "source_fingerprint": "284d547de4c18aa51d21387a1d55c674ecade43a099bf761645208b3e0fad44e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b4b9d9159ece48de253e949",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "克服激战获得英里重赏比赛7胜以上的话\\n能够与结下誓言的少女再会，获得力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccea8e6d2cee80b14bce291e659975a0f5eee547cc27cc8e02ee897b75ce18db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4e1857e526b893750555712",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了跑得更远、积累更多胜利，\\n对目标比赛充满了决心，变得更容易成长",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fabaa2815d238ccd288fa91637c0bffd0561005417a376d91094a1a49befafd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "31"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee6d4423fa5ca3c775f908a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "休息好了，今天继续努力！\\n经过心情调整，回合开始时会稍微回复体力",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a03a73ec03884cf39a22310cd25013e1510902e2e81ff51e94571b423c2b309",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4c213525722706bcb436220",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "帮助『U-TAS』的开发，机械完成时，\\n根据期间内的成功・失败次数获得相应的力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "78dc790f0f827fab9e9a57129309c6aff31d2c4a7c0ade459d79614ae91e55e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:919fbdb11c7fb6264cc7286d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在复苏的故乡作为舞台的决战中，为了开拓大家的未来\\n怀揣着对船桥的热爱，展现出坚定不移的力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4e62580ea23ec48c0978b893d285f9ab37848d6abe0a6c6cf8b56ef5b3c7e0c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "35"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a53a6bd5b0d13428817ff42a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与状态不佳抗争的日子持续着\\n就算参加比赛也无法发挥全部实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0dea577493be20fd5394cd2cb053031d0e26c9c180ab10e5f3a2bab9ffd80e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "36"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fcf9c1864f32ad984654602",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了跨越距离的壁垒，身心还不够成熟\\n无法想象自己能够奔跑，因此在中距离比赛中无法发挥全部实力",
      "source_fingerprint": "df3ee513231d55584d4da2b9cb2f27840fc0e845af00725fad22740f857afe37",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "37"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29d67b1574ce0ce45fadc957",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目标伴随着困难，想要克服考验证明自己的爱！\\n因为疼痛，在比赛中无法发挥全部实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b32d5b6f36830505de1e834784654c76dda35d0d16e6212cc22e278f480dcd1b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "38"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:905a1795616bc106480f9623",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "任凭冲动解放足以令所有人俯首称臣的末脚\\n胸怀对这一战的决意，发挥出全部实力",
      "source_fingerprint": "0343b9b5ebf2b6e8ce54403b430002b84b0ce1ede805e475bb216873c309c9ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "39"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10d4842d24a8c623436cb54e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "吃太多了，稍微胖了一点\\n在训练中无法提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "03894490be0806b0921d5906d16bfab115b03d169a8d104e11407c5e75aa7225",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8015a4b1e289dc85b7256aad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "英里赛是短期决战！抓不准节奏根本没法玩！好想回家……\n因动摇而脚步不稳，无法在英里赛事中发挥全力",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a9e2c8e141d12a7f83983f0fce9c11f070e76f9a905b59e634588a3cdc4649b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "44"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e25f2c9bf32e589728e9053",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为偏头痛的缘故，稍微有些忧郁\\n无法提升干劲（心情）",
      "source_fingerprint": "d76a85350fb01e0ea21602b9d92974915cb5edad458a2042a4863a8fb0903606",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c58cc51aa99adf8876cab4b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "且慢……注意脚下!\\n训练容易失败",
      "source_fingerprint": "55a72ab6c2492c73e008d7aa02d58a2271551b8797f785673d21c1fecdb23710",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "6"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
